 Messages exist in English (`en`) and Korean (`ko`), in
 `src/i18n/messages.js`. The server answers in `LARDER_LANG` (default `en`).
+
+## Routes
+
+See the complete route list in [README.md](../README.md#routes).
+
+`POST /import/sales` accepts `{ "csv": "..." }` with a header containing
+`ticket,soldAt,dishId,qty`. Each row sells a positive whole number of dish
+portions at an ISO instant. Previously imported tickets are skipped. The
+response contains `tickets` (distinct new tickets) and `dishes` (portions).
+The whole file is atomic; row errors identify the CSV line.
+
+`GET /reports/variance?from=YYYY-MM-DD&to=YYYY-MM-DD` returns an array of
+`{ itemId, theoretical, actual, difference }` in item ID order. Dates are
+inclusive UTC days; difference is actual minus theoretical. Theoretical use
+is captured from the recipe at sale import; actual use includes all consume
+movements. Quantities are in each item's unit.
